iff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/5878.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Objective\r\nSupport monitor selection for all window modes.\r\nFixes #5875.\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n\r\n* Moved `MonitorSelection` out of `WindowPosition::Centered`, into `WindowDescriptor`.\r\n* `WindowPosition::At` is now relative to the monitor instead of being in 'desktop space'.\r\n* Renamed `MonitorSelection::Number` to `MonitorSelection::Index` for clarity.\r\n* Added `WindowMode` to the prelude.\r\n* `Window::set_position` is now relative to a monitor and takes a `MonitorSelection` as argument.\r\n\r\n## Migration Guide\r\n\r\n`MonitorSelection` was moved out of `WindowPosition::Centered`, into `WindowDescriptor`.\r\n`MonitorSelection::Number` was renamed to `MonitorSelection::Index`.\r\n```rust\r\n// Before\r\n.insert_resource(WindowDescriptor {\r\n    position: WindowPosition::Centered(MonitorSelection::Number(1)),\r\n    ..default()\r\n})\r\n// After\r\n.insert_resource(WindowDescriptor {\r\n    monitor: MonitorSelection::Index(1),\r\n    position: WindowPosition::Centered,\r\n    ..default()\r\n})\r\n```\r\n`Window::set_position` now takes a `MonitorSelection` as argument.\r\n```rust\r\nwindow.set_position(MonitorSelection::Current, position);\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/5878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/5878/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"tim-blackbird","id":29694403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5Njk0NDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29694403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-blackbird","html_url":"https://github.com/tim-blackbird","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-blackbird/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co